      "standardized_narrative": "Opening gross claims outstanding were GBP 197.9m at 1 January 2023. During 2023 there was a net favourable prior-year run-off (release) of GBP 12.2m (gross), driven by favourable development mainly in Accident & Health (favourable GBP 15.1m) and smaller favourable movements in Marine and Energy, partly offset by adverse development in Casualty (GBP 14.4m). The movement is recorded in the Technical Provisions note and the syndicate also completed a 2023 LPT (ceding ~US$147m of reserves) which materially affected reinsurance recoverables and the presentation of net claims in the year.",
